Mixxx Preview (unofficial) for Android: NOTICE and third-party components
==========================================================================

This is an unofficial preview build of Mixxx with additional Android work. It is not
an official Mixxx release and is not endorsed by the Mixxx team.

Corresponding source
--------------------
The complete corresponding source of every release is this repository (branch
android-preview) at the commit named in that release's notes, plus the dependency
archive named below, which the scripts in tools/android-preview/ download, verify by
sha256 and use. Anyone who received the APK may request the source from the
repository's issue tracker; it is also available there without a request.

